<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Digest RH alertes taches</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 24px; color: #0f172a;">
<div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;">
    <div style="padding: 18px 20px; background: #1e293b; color: #ffffff;">
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px;">HrFlow - Digest RH des taches critiques</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 20px;">
        <p style="margin-top: 0;">Bonjour {{ recipientName ?: 'RH' }},</p>
        <p>Voici les taches en retard ou qui arrivent a echeance demain dans vos projets :</p>

        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px;">
            <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px; font-size: 12px;">Projet</th>
                <th style="text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px; font-size: 12px;">Employe</th>
                <th style="text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px; font-size: 12px;">Tache</th>
                <th style="text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px; font-size: 12px;">Echeance</th>
                <th style="text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 8px; font-size: 12px;">Alerte</th>
            </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for task in tasks %}
                <tr>
                    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px;">{{ task.project_name }}</td>
                    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px;">{{ task.employee_name ?: 'Non assigne' }}</td>
                    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px;">{{ task.title }}</td>
                    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px;">{{ task.due_date ?: 'N/A' }}</td>
                    <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 8px;">
                        {% if task.alert_type == 'overdue' %}
                            <span style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: 700;">En retard</span>
                        {% else %}
                            <span style="color: #d97706; font-weight: 700;">Echeance demain</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Merci de suivre ces taches pour limiter les retards de livraison.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 12px;">Digest genere le {{ date|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>

